{"id":"659330","name":"奥尔良蜜汁五花肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659330/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"奥尔良蜜汁腌料","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五花肉洗净去皮（皮忘记去了，后面去掉的）。","img":"images/659330/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入适量蚝油。","img":"images/659330/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入奥尔良蜜汁腌料。","img":"images/659330/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量花生油和蜂蜜。","img":"images/659330/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉抓均匀。","img":"images/659330/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放置冰箱冷藏腌制一晚更入味。","img":"images/659330/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腌入味的五花肉放入烤盘中。","img":"images/659330/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"风炉230度烤30分钟左右。","img":"images/659330/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烤好的五花肉取出晾凉。","img":"images/659330/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"晾凉后再切薄片。","img":"images/659330/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659330/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659330/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}